# JOURNEY · the Deep: pick the new game's three fish, pack a meal, ride the first elevator on Normal, walk into the first room, leave, and find the dive waiting.
# Every map is rolled fresh, so the journey only expects what every first room shows: its own menu and the way out.

run /dungeon
expect The Deep · Party
expect ENTER pick
key enter
expect in the party
key down
key enter
key down
key enter
expect TAB pack
snap three fish picked
key tab
expect The Deep · Items
expect Food
key right
expect 1 of 10
snap one meal packed
key enter
expect Elevator
expect Normal
expect ENTER ride
key enter
expect The Shallows
expect ENTER go
snap the first floor
key enter
expect ESC leave
snap the first room
key esc
absent ESC leave
run /dungeon
expect ESC leave
snap the room was waiting where it was left
